@host = http://localhost:8080

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 0) Health
GET {{host}}/server-key

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 1) (Optional) Cast a few votes first so /start?source=live has data
POST {{host}}/vote
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id":"u100","name":"Alice Example","address":"123 Main St","age":34,"candidate":2 }

###
POST {{host}}/vote
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id":"u101","name":"Bob Example","address":"45 Side St","age":41,"candidate":0 }

###
POST {{host}}/vote
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id":"u102","name":"Carol Example","address":"9 Elm Rd","age":29,"candidate":3 }

### Inspect blocks / verifier feed (optional)
GET {{host}}/blocks
###
GET {{host}}/user-votes

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2) Start MPC session from the LIVE chain snapshot (no CLI, no upload)
### You may pin the candidate count explicitly by adding "candidates": 4
POST {{host}}/mpc/sessions/start
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "live", "candidates": 4 }

### Capture session id
@sid = {{last_response.body.$.session.id}}

### List small artifact metadata
GET {{host}}/mpc/sessions/{{sid}}/artifacts

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 3) DEV masking (server generates & applies masks; insecure IRL)
POST {{host}}/mpc/sessions/{{sid}}/mask:server
Content-Type: application/json

{ "who": "A", "seed": 1234 }

###
POST {{host}}/mpc/sessions/{{sid}}/mask:server
Content-Type: application/json

{ "who": "B", "seed": 5678 }

### Check transcript (big arrays live on disk under verifier/sessions/<sid>)
GET {{host}}/mpc/sessions/{{sid}}
###
GET {{host}}/mpc/sessions/{{sid}}/artifacts

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4) DEV decrypt of masked totals (auto-loads public/u16_client_key.bin)
POST {{host}}/mpc/sessions/{{sid}}/decrypt
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Inspect masked plaintext totals (artifact list)
GET {{host}}/mpc/sessions/{{sid}}/artifacts

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 5) Reveal masks (paste arrays from verifier/sessions/<sid>/masks_*.json)
POST {{host}}/mpc/sessions/{{sid}}/reveal
Content-Type: application/json

{ "who": "A", "masks": [ /* paste from masks_A.json */ ] }

###
POST {{host}}/mpc/sessions/{{sid}}/reveal
Content-Type: application/json

{ "who": "B", "masks": [ /* paste from masks_B.json */ ] }

### Final transcript + artifact list (totals.json should be present)
GET {{host}}/mpc/sessions/{{sid}}
###
GET {{host}}/mpc/sessions/{{sid}}/artifacts

### Optional: download full transcript as a zip
GET {{host}}/mpc/sessions/{{sid}}/zip
